        <activityName xml:lang="en">Foaming, expanding</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Foaming, expanding
1 kg of this process equals 1 kg of expanded plastics (usually polystyrene).;
UUID: b3b41a43-872c-3ca4-be87-9ac9b9fdd1fd
This process contains the auxillaries and energy demand for the mentioned convertion process of plastics. The converted amount of plastics is NOT included into the dataset.
Location: Information from one Swiss insulation material production site - used as European average data.
Technology: production of insulation panels
Time period: Time of publication
Production volume: na
Sampling: company data 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b3b41a43-872c-3ca4-be87-9ac9b9fdd1fd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
